  "prefLabel": "En 1004.06 Continued Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1004.06 Continued Review. If an application does not qualify for interconnection under one review path, but the applicant decides to continue with review under another review path within 10 business days of receipt of utility denial of elected review path, the applicant shall retain its original queue position.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
